# The Ten Moves Only challenge on a phone held sideways (844 x 390): a
# stocker and a cashier hired from the staff drawer (two moves), then the
# staff run the market to the results.
# viewport 844x390@1
until 300 All modes
frames 10
click =All modes
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click =Challenge
until 60 Challenges
frames 10
click Ten Moves Only
until 60 Start shift
frames 10
save challenge-setup
click =Start shift
until 300 Checkout 1
frames 10
click =Toggle staff panel
until 60 Hire stocker
frames 10
click Hire stocker (cost
until 60 on shift
frames 10
click Hire cashier (cost
until 60 Moves left: 8
frames 10
save staff-hired
until 6000 Shift complete
frames 60
save results
